  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-cc6c211668d7490d2823a31e",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "给定矩阵对 (A, B)，当且仅当系统完全可控——即当且仅当可控性矩阵 P_c 满秩（对于单输入单输出系统，满秩意味着 P_c 可逆）时，我们总能确定 K 将所有系统闭环极点配置在左半平面。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Given the pair (A, B), we can always determine K to place all the system closed-loop poles in the left half-plane if and only if the system is completely controllable—that is, if and only if the controllability matrix P_c is full rank (for a single-input, single-output system, full rank implies that P_c is invertible).",
